# Runtime trivy findings accepted in the nginx-gateway namespace only.

# KSV-0024: container sets host ports.
# The NGINX data plane publishes the platform Gateway on the node's ports 80
# and 443: a home server has no external load balancer in front of it. This is
# the only workload allowed to bind host ports.
KSV-0024

# KSV-0056: role can manage Services.
# The gateway controller creates the Service of the data plane it provisions;
# the Role is namespaced and limited to nginx-gateway.
KSV-0056
